{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What happens after you die?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What is the afterlife, if there even is one?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You go into the light and...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">find out it's playing cards with a skeleton man. Well, it is for you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hogen</strong> is a <strong>digital card game</strong> drawing inspiration from Gwent and Magic: the Gathering. Place weapon, unit, and magical crystal shard cards to activate abilities and overpower your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can be played with just a mouse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unravel a story of Life and Death as progress through the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575520/extras/life.png?t=1742453245\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play against vibrant and animated boards with custom dynamic music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575520/extras/waterLevel.png?t=1742453245\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect cards and build your own deck to grow your power</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575520/extras/airLevel.png?t=1742453245\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3575520?t=1742453245","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575520/93923f8951e14abe252dd660cc720445a0271524/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742453245","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575520/15c0c32f247de54b87c04ff4ec8d98c05ef084f5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742453245","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575520/15c0c32f247de54b87c04ff4ec8d98c05ef084f5/capsule_184x